From: Stained Glass OS contributors
Subject: shell32, notepad: our own folder, file, text file and Notepad icons

David: folders and files "look old", and a text file showed Wine's notepad
icon (a wine glass with a pencil). theme/icons.py (run by build.sh after the
series) writes our own flat drawings over folder.svg, folder_open.svg,
document.svg and notepad.svg and adds sg_text.svg, and build.sh renders them
at 16 to 256 pixels (theme/images.list). Here: IDI_SHELL_TEXT_FILE is the
text page, and .txt files (txtfile) use it, as Windows gives text files a
document icon of their own rather than Notepad's.

--- a/dlls/shell32/shell32.rc
+++ b/dlls/shell32/shell32.rc
@@ -652,8 +652,9 @@
 IDI_SHELL_CONFIG_FILE ICON resources/document.ico
 
 /* FIXME: Following resource is not yet added */
-/* @makedep: resources/document.ico */
-IDI_SHELL_TEXT_FILE ICON resources/document.ico
+/* Stained Glass OS: a text file has a page with lines (theme/icons.py) */
+/* @makedep: resources/sg_text.ico */
+IDI_SHELL_TEXT_FILE ICON resources/sg_text.ico
 
 /* FIXME: Following resource is not yet added */
 /* @makedep: resources/window.ico */
--- a/loader/wine.inf.in
+++ b/loader/wine.inf.in
@@ -490,6 +490,7 @@
 HKCR,rtffile\shell\open\command,,2,"""%16422%\Windows NT\Accessories\wordpad.exe"" ""%1"""
 HKCR,rtffile\shell\print\command,,2,"""%16422%\Windows NT\Accessories\wordpad.exe"" /p ""%1"""
 HKCR,txtfile,,2,"Text Document"
+HKCR,txtfile\DefaultIcon,,2,"%11%\shell32.dll,-152"
 HKCR,txtfile\shell\open\command,,2,"""%11%\notepad.exe"" ""%1"""
 HKCR,txtfile\shell\print\command,,2,"""%11%\notepad.exe"" /p ""%1"""
 HKCR,wrifile\shell\open\command,,2,"""%16422%\Windows NT\Accessories\wordpad.exe"" ""%1"""
